      "setting": "Rovelle · the winter she is seventeen",
      "summary_en": "A winter current is coming, and the city wants to use Mira's tidal chart beyond the conditions it was tested in. To correct the record she has to make its limits public, and let other people into a decision that cannot be hers alone.",
