      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "setting": "MØBIUS Station · her first winter",
      "summary_en": "Three days north of Ailan, a station without a name keeps its deep-water record on a paper loop twisted half a turn. For nineteen winters, part of the sea in it was written off as ink bleeding through the paper.",
      "summary_zh": "艾兰以北三天的航程，一座还没有名字的研究站，把深水记录写在一条扭了半圈的纸带上。十九个冬天里，有一部分海，被写成了「透印，不计」。",
      "quote_zh": "她只是沿着同一面，往前走了很远。",
      "quote_en": "She had only gone a long way along the same side.",
